WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:04.580
Detection rules transform telemetry into actionable signals that support defenders.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:08.150
Effective rules begin with meaningful behaviors, use appropriate data sources,

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.100
balance signal and noise, document assumptions clearly, validate performance,

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.150
and evolve over time.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.670
The goal is not to generate alerts for their own sake.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:19.940
The goal is helping analysts identify and investigate activity that matters while keeping

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.080
detections maintainable,

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.440
understandable, and operationally useful.
